      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for libxml2 fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2025-9714: Fixed inifinite recursion at exsltDynMapFunction function in libexslt/dynamic.c (bsc#1249076)\n- CVE-2025-8732: Fixed infinite recursion in catalog parsing functions when processing malformed SGML catalog files (bsc#1247850)\n",
